  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I remember that whole day clearly, until I stood weeping and praising God on Primrose Hill.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 6.54
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then I forget.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.292,
      "seconds": 2.2
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Others found the dead Martians before me. The news flew to Paris, and all England rang bells.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 10.0,
      "seconds": 7.48
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The Last Man Left Alive! Hurrah! The Last Man Left Alive!",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 18.0,
      "seconds": 5.26
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Kind strangers sheltered me. Gently, they told me Leatherhead was gone, every soul in it.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 23.792,
      "seconds": 7.86
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I stayed four days.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 32.167,
      "seconds": 2.18
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then the craving to see my home won. I left them in tears, and took a free train.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 34.875,
      "seconds": 5.86
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I sat alone and watched the ruins flow past.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 41.25,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Just past the terminus, every house was a blackened shell.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 45.458,
      "seconds": 4.58
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Every little stream lay choked with red weed, like butcher's meat and pickled cabbage.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 50.542,
      "seconds": 6.11
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It hurt to look at.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 57.167,
      "seconds": 1.57
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The line was broken before Woking, so I left the train at Byfleet and walked toward Maybury.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 59.25,
      "seconds": 6.06
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "In the weed I found the dog cart, warped and broken, and the horse's gnawed white bones.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 65.833,
      "seconds": 7.02
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I stood a long time.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 73.375,
      "seconds": 2.61
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A man at a cottage door called my name, and I walked on.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 77.125,
      "seconds": 4.06
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I looked at my house with a flash of hope. It faded at once.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 81.708,
      "seconds": 4.03
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The door was forced.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 86.375,
      "seconds": 1.37
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It slammed.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 88.445,
      "seconds": 1.65
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Upstairs, under its selenite weight, my unfinished paper still lay on the desk, broken mid-sentence.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 90.625,
      "seconds": 7.67
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The mutton lay rotting. My home was desolate.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 98.833,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A voice said no one had escaped but me. I turned.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 103.208,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "And there on the step, amazed and afraid as I was, stood my cousin and my wife.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 108.708,
      "seconds": 5.86
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "My wife, white and tearless.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 115.083,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I made a step across the room, toward the open window.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 118.708,
      "seconds": 4.12
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "She gave a faint cry, and at last I believed.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 123.333,
      "seconds": 3.46
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "She stood on the threshold, one hand at her throat.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 128.5,
      "seconds": 3.87
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "narrators_wife",
      "text": "I came. I knew... I knew...",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 133.875,
      "seconds": 2.53
    }
  ],
  "plan": "89658e1c9ad48200"
}